# Learn to Play: lesson 1 by pointer (the tray's first piece, then a board
# cell by its screen-reader name), the next lessons by hint and Enter (lesson
# 2 needs a cleared line) until the lessons end; then pause and leave.
until 300 Play
frames 30
click =Learn to Play
until 120 1/5 — Place a parcel
frames 30
save learn-1
click =Select Twin Column, slot 1
frames 5
click =Row 1 column 1, empty
until 30 2/5 — Fill lines
frames 5
expect =Row 1 column 1, occupied
repeat 3000 until 5/5 — Watch the board
  key KeyH 1
  frames 3
  key Enter 1
  frames 12
end
frames 10
save learn-5
key KeyH 1
frames 3
key Enter 1
frames 30
key Escape 1
until 60 =Resume
frames 10
click =Leave Round
until 120 Journey stage 1/40
